    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d292">

                <pb facs="0575" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1876/pg519"/>

                <head>No. 282.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish
                        to Mr. Cushing.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-09-28"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 28,
                        1875</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The promotion of Burriel, and omission to observe the engagement to investigate,
                    involve very grave consequences, and cannot be considered other than a serious
                    disregard of the obligations of Spain to this Government.</p>
                <closer><signed>FISH, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
